Package: ermeeth2
Type: Package
Title: Functions Used by the ThreeME Team
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("ThreeME", "Team", role = "aut"),
    person("Anissa", "Saumtally", , "anissa.saumtally@sciencespo.fr", role = "cre")
  )
Description: Helper functions used by the ThreeME team to run, post-process and
    document ThreeME v4 simulations: data loading and reshaping, scenario
    running, contribution computations, plots, tables and documentation
    rendering. This is the successor to the 'ermeeth' package.
URL: https://github.com/ThreeME-org/ermeeth2
BugReports: https://github.com/ThreeME-org/ermeeth2/issues
